   "source": [
    "# 3-Wheeler EV Adoption Analysis — India\n",
    "\n",
    "**Strategic market research & feasibility assessment of electric 3-wheelers (E3Ws) as a mainstream mobility solution for India.**\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook is the quantitative backbone of the project. It combines **public data from Kaggle** (state-level EV sales, charging infrastructure) with a **structured framework for primary research** (driver interviews) to answer four questions:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **How big is the E3W market and how fast is it growing?** (market sizing & trend)\n",
    "2. **Where is adoption happening, and how concentrated is it?** (state-level analysis)\n",
    "3. **Does it pay off for a driver?** (unit economics / total cost of ownership)\n",
    "4. **What is holding adoption back, and which business models address it?** (driver interviews → barriers → business models)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Contents**\n",
    "\n",
    "| # | Section |\n",
    "|---|---------|\n",
    "| 1 | Setup & configuration |\n",
    "| 2 | Data acquisition (Kaggle) |\n",
    "| 3 | Cleaning & standardisation |\n",
    "| 4 | Market structure — MECE segmentation |\n",
    "| 5 | Adoption trend & growth |\n",
    "| 6 | Geography — where is adoption happening? |\n",
    "| 7 | Charging infrastructure vs. adoption |\n",
    "| 8 | Unit economics — EV vs. ICE/CNG 3-wheeler |\n",
    "| 9 | Regulatory landscape |\n",
    "| 10 | Driver interviews — barriers to adoption |\n",
    "| 11 | Business models |\n",
    "| 12 | Key findings & export |"
   ]
  },
  {
