   "id": "f8b1c6d6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Market structure — MECE segmentation\n",
    "\n",
    "To size the opportunity without gaps or double counting, the Indian 3-wheeler market is broken into **Mutually Exclusive, Collectively Exhaustive** layers:\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "Indian 3-wheeler market\n",
    "├── By powertrain ........ ICE (petrol / diesel / LPG) | CNG | Electric        <- this notebook sizes the Electric branch\n",
    "│                                                                                 (ICE/CNG volumes need VAHAN data, see README)\n",
    "└── Electric 3-wheelers\n",
    "    ├── By use case ...... Passenger (shared autos, e-rickshaws) | Cargo (last-mile goods)\n",
    "    ├── By geography ..... State / UT (36)\n",
    "    └── By time .......... Year / month\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Each layer is a partition: the segment totals below must add up to the total, which the notebook asserts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "id": "4cc3aa37",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "seg_tbl = ev3w.groupby(\"segment\")[\"units\"].sum().sort_values(ascending=False).to_frame(\"units\")\n",
    "seg_tbl[\"share\"] = seg_tbl[\"units\"] / seg_tbl[\"units\"].sum()\n",
    "\n",
    "# MECE check: segments are exclusive and exhaustive -> shares add up to exactly 100 %\n",
    "assert np.isclose(seg_tbl[\"share\"].sum(), 1.0) and np.isclose(seg_tbl[\"units\"].sum(), ev3w[\"units\"].sum())\n",
    "\n",
    "display(seg_tbl.style.format({\"units\": \"{:,.0f}\", \"share\": \"{:.1%}\"}))\n",
    "\n",
    "seg_year = ev3w.pivot_table(index=\"year\", columns=\"segment\", values=\"units\", aggfunc=\"sum\", fill_value=0)\n",
    "ax = seg_year.plot(kind=\"bar\", stacked=True, figsize=(10, 4.5), width=0.8)\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"Electric 3-wheeler sales by segment\")\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel(\"\")\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"Units sold\")\n",
    "ax.yaxis.set_major_formatter(mtick.FuncFormatter(lambda v, _: f\"{v/1000:,.0f}k\"))\n",
    "ax.legend(title=\"Segment\", frameon=False)\n",
    "plt.xticks(rotation=0)\n",
    "save_fig(\"01_segments_by_year\")\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "868035bf",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Adoption trend & growth"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "id": "19615f37",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "annual_3w = ev3w.groupby(\"year\")[\"units\"].sum()\n",
    "annual_all = ev.groupby(\"year\")[\"units\"].sum()\n",
    "\n",
    "yoy = annual_3w.pct_change()\n",
    "# YoY only meaningful between consecutive complete years\n",
    "yoy = yoy[[y for y in yoy.index if y in complete_years and (y - 1) in complete_years]]\n",
    "\n",
    "# CAGR over (up to) the last 5 complete years that have non-zero 3W sales\n",
    "valid_years = [y for y in complete_years if annual_3w.get(y, 0) > 0]\n",
    "start_year = valid_years[-6] if len(valid_years) >= 6 else valid_years[0]\n",
    "periods = LATEST - start_year\n",
    "cagr_3w = (annual_3w[LATEST] / annual_3w[start_year]) ** (1 / periods) - 1 if periods > 0 else np.nan\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax1 = plt.subplots(figsize=(10, 4.5))\n",
    "colors = [\"#9aa5b1\" if y in partial_years else \"#1f77b4\" for y in annual_3w.index]\n",
    "ax1.bar(annual_3w.index, annual_3w.values, color=colors)\n",
    "ax1.set_ylabel(\"Electric 3W units sold\")\n",
    "ax1.yaxis.set_major_formatter(mtick.FuncFormatter(lambda v, _: f\"{v/1000:,.0f}k\"))\n",
    "ax1.set_title(\"Electric 3-wheeler sales and year-on-year growth\" + (\" (grey = partial year)\" if partial_years else \"\"))\n",
    "ax1.set_xticks(annual_3w.index)\n",
    "\n",
    "ax2 = ax1.twinx()\n",
    "ax2.plot(yoy.index, yoy.values * 100, color=\"#d62728\", marker=\"o\", lw=2)\n",
    "ax2.set_ylabel(\"YoY growth (%)\", color=\"#d62728\")\n",
    "ax2.grid(False)\n",
    "save_fig(\"02_annual_sales_growth\")\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"{LATEST}: {fmt_int(annual_3w[LATEST])} electric 3W units\")\n",
    "print(f\"CAGR {start_year}-{LATEST}: {cagr_3w:.1%}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "id": "e811456d",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ---- How big is the 3W slice of the whole EV market? ----\n",
    "mix = ev.pivot_table(index=\"year\", columns=\"category\", values=\"units\", aggfunc=\"sum\", fill_value=0)\n",
    "mix_share = mix.div(mix.sum(axis=1), axis=0)\n",
    "share_3w_total = ev3w.groupby(\"year\")[\"units\"].sum() / annual_all\n",
    "\n",
    "ax = (mix_share * 100).plot(kind=\"bar\", stacked=True, figsize=(10, 4.5), width=0.8, colormap=\"tab20c\")\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"Composition of India's EV sales by vehicle category\")\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel(\"\")\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"Share of EV units (%)\")\n",
    "ax.legend(title=\"Category\", bbox_to_anchor=(1.01, 1), loc=\"upper left\", frameon=False)\n",
    "plt.xticks(rotation=0)\n",
    "save_fig(\"03_ev_mix_by_category\")\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"3-wheelers were {share_3w_total[LATEST]:.1%} of all EV units sold in {LATEST}.\")"
   ]
