    "## 8. Unit economics — EV vs. CNG/ICE 3-wheeler\n",
    "\n",
    "Adoption ultimately comes down to whether a driver earns more with an EV. This section models **annual running cost** and **payback period** on the higher upfront price.\n",
    "\n",
    "> ⚠️ **The values below are illustrative placeholders, not sourced data.** Replace them with figures from OEM spec sheets, current fuel/electricity tariffs and, ideally, what drivers told you in interviews, and cite the source next to each one. The conclusions are only as good as these inputs, which is why the sensitivity table below matters more than the base case."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "id": "96590fc6",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "ASSUMPTIONS = {\n",
    "    # --- usage ---\n",
    "    \"daily_km\": 100,                 # km per day for a shared auto / e-rickshaw\n",
    "    \"days_per_year\": 300,\n",
    "    # --- vehicle prices (INR, ex-showroom, after any subsidy you want to include) ---\n",
    "    \"ev_price_inr\": 350_000,\n",
    "    \"ice_price_inr\": 280_000,\n",
    "    # --- electric 3W ---\n",
    "    \"ev_kwh_per_km\": 0.09,\n",
    "    \"electricity_inr_per_kwh\": 10.0,\n",
    "    \"ev_maint_inr_per_km\": 0.40,\n",
    "    \"battery_cost_inr\": 120_000,\n",
    "    \"battery_life_years\": 5,\n",
    "    # --- CNG 3W ---\n",
    "    \"cng_price_inr_per_kg\": 80.0,\n",
    "    \"cng_km_per_kg\": 30.0,\n",
    "    \"ice_maint_inr_per_km\": 1.00,\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "def tco(daily_km=None, cng_price=None, a=ASSUMPTIONS):\n",
    "    daily_km = a[\"daily_km\"] if daily_km is None else daily_km\n",
    "    cng_price = a[\"cng_price_inr_per_kg\"] if cng_price is None else cng_price\n",
    "    km_year = daily_km * a[\"days_per_year\"]\n",
    "    ev_cost = km_year * (a[\"ev_kwh_per_km\"] * a[\"electricity_inr_per_kwh\"] + a[\"ev_maint_inr_per_km\"]) \\\n",
    "              + a[\"battery_cost_inr\"] / a[\"battery_life_years\"]            # battery wear annualised\n",
    "    ice_cost = km_year * (cng_price / a[\"cng_km_per_kg\"] + a[\"ice_maint_inr_per_km\"])\n",
    "    savings = ice_cost - ev_cost\n",
    "    premium = a[\"ev_price_inr\"] - a[\"ice_price_inr\"]\n",
    "    payback = premium / savings if savings > 0 else np.inf\n",
    "    return {\"ev_cost\": ev_cost, \"ice_cost\": ice_cost, \"savings\": savings, \"premium\": premium, \"payback_years\": payback}\n",
    "\n",
    "base = tco()\n",
    "print(f\"Annual running cost  EV: INR {base['ev_cost']:,.0f}  |  CNG: INR {base['ice_cost']:,.0f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Annual saving with EV: INR {base['savings']:,.0f}  |  upfront premium: INR {base['premium']:,.0f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Payback on the price premium: {base['payback_years']:.1f} years\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- Sensitivity: payback (years) vs. daily distance and CNG price ----\n",
    "km_grid = [50, 70, 100, 130, 160]\n",
    "cng_grid = [65, 75, 85, 95, 105]\n",
    "sens = pd.DataFrame([[tco(k, p)[\"payback_years\"] for k in km_grid] for p in cng_grid],\n",
    "                    index=[f\"INR {p}/kg\" for p in cng_grid], columns=[f\"{k} km/day\" for k in km_grid])\n",
    "sens_plot = sens.replace(np.inf, np.nan)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 4.2))\n",
    "sns.heatmap(sens_plot, annot=True, fmt=\".1f\", cmap=\"RdYlGn_r\", cbar_kws={\"label\": \"payback (years)\"}, linewidths=0.5, ax=ax)\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"Payback on EV price premium - sensitivity to usage and CNG price\")\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel(\"Daily distance\"); ax.set_ylabel(\"CNG price\")\n",
    "save_fig(\"08_payback_sensitivity\")\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
