    "### Limitations & next steps\n",
    "\n",
    "* **Registrations ≠ demand.** The Kaggle sales data reflects registrations (VAHAN-style), so unregistered/informal e-rickshaws are likely under-counted — a known issue in this segment.\n",
    "* **No ICE/CNG denominator.** True *penetration* (EV share of all 3W sales) needs fuel-wise registrations; the Kaggle datasets *Veh Registrations in India from 2020 to 2024* or *Indian Vehicle Registration Data (2020–25)* can be joined in a follow-up.\n",
    "* **Unit economics are assumption-driven.** Replace placeholders with sourced values and re-run; report the sensitivity range, not a single number.\n",
    "* **Interview sample.** 15+ interviews is a qualitative sample — treat percentages as directional, not statistically representative.\n",
    "* **Next:** state-level forecasting (e.g. Prophet / SARIMAX), a Streamlit dashboard on `reports/tables/`, and a TCO model with finance cost."
